[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0059","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-0753","title":"PHP PCNTL扩展条件竞争拒绝服务漏洞","description":"PHP 5.3.4 之前版本的 PCNTL 扩展中存在条件竞争漏洞。当应用程序注册了用户自定义信号处理函数时，攻击者可通过发送大量并发信号触发该竞态条件，导致内存损坏，最终造成拒绝服务。攻击者需要具备向目标 PHP 进程发送信号的能力，攻击复杂度较高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0753"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-02-02T22:00:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:28:00Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 5.3.4 或更高版本。PHP 5.3.4 已修复 PCNTL 扩展中的条件竞争漏洞，可通过官方源码编译升级或使用系统包管理器（如 yum update php、apt-get upgrade php5）安装最新安全更新。如无法立即升级，可在 php.ini 中禁用 pcntl 扩展（extension=pcntl.so 前加分号注释）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/52784","http://www.php.net/ChangeLog-5.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/65431","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A12271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0753.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-0753","https://github.com/coreruleset/coreruleset/blob/76204946a679c0d5c634bd65e1d606f191ad756e/regex-assembly/942220.ra","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/ignored/CVE-2011-0753","https://github.com/bunkerity/bunkerweb/blob/2ae80bbbe46e7253fd080df807dceb9d20a60a77/src/common/core/modsecurity/files/coreruleset-v4/regex-assembly/942220.ra","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-0753","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-0753.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2011/CVE-2011-0753.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-0753.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-0753"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0059.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0003","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-0518","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16355,\"outputTokens\":28,\"totalTokens\":16383}}","description":"LotusCMS Fraise 3.0 版本的 core/lib/router.php 文件存在目录遍历（本地文件包含）漏洞。当服务器关闭 magic_quotes_gpc 安全配置时，未经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 index.php 发送带有特制 system 参数的 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取并包含服务器上的任意本地文件。攻击者可借此查看敏感文件内容，甚至通过包含含恶意代码的文件实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 LotusCMS Fraise 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分为 5.1，危害等级为中危，利用前提为目标系统未启用 magic_quotes_gpc 且可直接访问 Web 服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0518"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2011-01-20T19:00:12Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:27:32Z","remediation":"建议升级 LotusCMS Fraise 至 3.0.1 或更高版本（已修复该目录遍历漏洞），或迁移至维护中的 CMS。临时缓解：在 php.ini 中开启 magic_quotes_gpc=On（PHP 5.4+ 已移除），或设置 open_basedir 限制文件访问范围，同时设置 allow_url_include=Off 禁用远程文件包含。建议升级 PHP 至 5.4+ 版本以移除 magic_quotes_gpc 依赖并启用 open_basedir 限制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/70409","http://secunia.com/advisories/42835","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15964","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2011/0073","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/64736","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15964","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-0518.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-0518.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e7bd0957d7eea7c21095268cca9721e428611ed/cves/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0518.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-0518","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/12fae384c4fef6ba595f65eae09dc323d97a95f4/reports/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-0518.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/968abdc74763b43a3cdd216fbb1950cab484f982/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/masahiro331/nvd-list/blob/4937ab886b2d99e2047bc7eafc242f2653ee7558/cves/2011/CVE-2011-0518.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra","https://github.com/rojo32/python/blob/2af471c8b7440b4c4dfa80f54c96eb69c3a465ee/Proyecto_Scrapy/vulneravilidades/vulneravilidades/spiders/vulnerabilidades.csv","https://github.com/Kuduxaaa/hunting-knowledge-base/blob/e9de2ea715300eb67318e21f3930704d36ad8d2b/signatures/nuclei/http/cves/2011/CVE-2011-0518.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/bf9978ea592b7413bb96dfeb9db92cbd52bf0c3d/api/2011/CVE-2011-0518.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0003.toml"}]